00:49:38,181 --> 00:49:44,181
Ruby Gillman, Teenage Kraken is a 2023 American animated
comedy film produced by DreamWorks Animation.

13
00:53:46,363 --> 00:53:52,363
Directed by Kirk DeMicco and written by Brian C.

14
00:57:54,545 --> 00:58:00,545
Brown, Elliott DiGuiseppi and Pam Brady, it stars the voices of Lana Condor,
Toni Collette, Annie Murphy, Colman Domingo, and Jane Fonda.

15
01:02:02,727 --> 01:02:08,727
The film follows a shy Kraken girl named Ruby Gillman (Condor)
who is desperate to fit in at Oceanside High.

16
01:06:10,909 --> 01:06:16,909
When she breaks her mother's (Collette) rule by going into the ocean with any would-be friends, she discovers that she is a direct descendant of battle-hardened
krakens who have protected the sea from evil mermaids for generations, and is also destined to inherit the throne from her grandmother (Fonda).

17
01:10:19,090 --> 01:10:25,090
Ruby Gillman, Teenage Kraken had its world premiere at the Annecy International Animation Film Festival
on June 15, 2023, and was released in the United States by Universal Pictures on June 30.

18
01:14:27,272 --> 01:14:33,272
The film received mixed reviews from critics, who praised the voice
acting and characters but criticized the screenplay.

19
01:18:35,454 --> 01:18:41,454
It was a box-office failure, grossing $46 million against a $70 million budget.

20
01:22:43,636 --> 01:22:49,636
The film explores themes of high school, ocean, boat, transformation, fisherman.

21
